{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_11_level_main_11-08_end","groupId":"main_11","stageId":"main_11-08","title":"以命换命","storyCode":"11-9","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_11-08_end.txt","sourceHash":"236709234811d5bd364867838aa41d7a8f86725b75c958e3606dd9fc5819abf3","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"费斯特鼓舞众工人，并在博士与阿斯卡纶的帮助下，成功解救凯瑟琳。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔治，愿意去的人，都在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤米呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤米他不见了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，本来就是自愿的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔治叔叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，看来你找到了凯瑟琳留给你的东西，是你想要的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你拿到了，那就快走吧，不然，可能就走不了了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，发生了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道那些萨卡兹把凯瑟琳带去干什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她知道的太多了，他们要把像她一样的工人秘密处决掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚才我就觉得不对，让戴爬到工厂上面确认了这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说......什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"凯瑟琳瞒着我们，以为我们什么都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们也不傻，多多少少也猜到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......然后你们要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不做什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们忍了这些萨卡兹很长时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"许多人都习惯了，习惯了这种温吞水的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"甚至许多人以为，只要再忍一忍，萨卡兹就会放过我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，他们现在打算拿凯瑟琳开刀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们会死的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那也好过眼睁睁看着凯瑟琳被他们杀死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聚集在这里的，都是没有后顾之忧的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经是自救军的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的事迹我们都听说过，不少人其实都为你们高兴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你有更重要的事要做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别让凯瑟琳的牺牲白费。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，虽然我获得了奶奶留给我的情报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，作为这座军工厂的工人代表，奶奶本人无疑是对萨卡兹的生产线走向最为了解的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她在战略上有着重要的价值，对吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"毫无疑问。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我不否认。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那么，我想请求罗德岛的协助。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿斯卡纶，你在吗？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我记得你盯着......陪着我。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"想必你已经摸清楚了这个区块的敌军配置。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"请描述一下这个区块的敌人配置吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们收紧了防御。外围漏洞百出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看守中外围这些区块的，大多是一些结构松散的雇佣兵团体。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们需要一些时间。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"转移雇佣兵的视线，解决那些斥候。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们，博士，阿斯卡纶小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"费斯特深吸了一口气。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_i04"},{"type":"narration","text":"他将自己的工牌贴在胸口，走进了工人们的队伍当中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别做蠢事，费斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大伙，我并不是以自救军成员的身份站在这里的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是以在这座工厂长大的、工人代表凯瑟琳孙子的身份站在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我属于这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我和你们一样，不希望凯瑟琳死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我不仅不会让凯瑟琳死去，我也不会让你们死去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这位博士的手下会帮我们切断萨卡兹的情报传递。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只要能把奶奶和其他工人代表救出来，我们会有充足的时间撤离海布里区。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我会带着你们去和自救军会合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所有人都会得救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......所有人都应该得救。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"工人们面面相觑。\n但他们都看到了彼此眼中缓缓燃起的希望之火。\n他们开始自发地走动，走到费斯特身后。\n他们决定相信费斯特。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，我、我也去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"汤米......你还是来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你还是不要去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爸爸身体不好，所以你才犹豫了，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我有件事想要拜托你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管结果怎么样，半个小时后，去向萨卡兹举报，就说我们这些工人，擅自行动去闹事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也很重要，我不能害了留在这里的兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，各位，让我们出发吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"去把我们的老工头们救回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯瑟琳默默地抽着烟。\n她看着那些萨卡兹将一个个熟悉的老面孔拖到临时的刑场上。\n她能看到那些老面孔或愤怒，或放弃，或厌恶。\n最后，归于平静。\n她知道，很快就会轮到自己。\n她感觉心中空前地宁静。\n费斯特说的是正确的。\n妥协与顺从同样无法解决问题。\n她必须为自己的选择付出代价。\n但她至少在付出代价前，又见到了自己的孙子一面，并给他留下了一点东西。\n这就足够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"到你了，老家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"把她押过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我自己会走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，明椒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"格林应该没让你杀过人吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那这是个好机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你该试着学会杀人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹就是这么对待孩子的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我听到了你说的话，你说得对，她还不知道战争是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"如果可以，我也不希望知道什么是战争。每一个萨卡兹都是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们没有给我们选择。你们所有人都没有。所以现在，她该知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我喜欢你的眼神，老家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"每当我发现那些死不瞑目的战友时，他们，也往往都是这种眼神。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"我杀过很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，把这些没有反抗能力的人一个个处决的感觉，还挺怪的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不想干的话，可以回你来的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道这些工人过去造的武器有没有被用来杀你的同胞？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们在打仗。道德是留给和平的。我们从没有机会真正公平地讨论这个话题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"不用你来告诉我这点，我只是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？无人机？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是现在！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我用无人机在外围侦察过了，就是这里没错！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们冲进去！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......不能交给别人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"格林应该教过你，队长的命令对雇佣兵来说是绝对的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"今天，要么你杀了这个老东西，要么，放下武器，但我会了结你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"动手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我做不到！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......我早就说过，格林太护着你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不是来说服维多利亚人把家园还给我们的。没法动手，你可得吃点苦头——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"唔——无人机？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"队长，有许多工人冲进来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_660_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特，我们这边有博士帮忙指挥，我们会帮你牵制住其他雇佣兵，凯瑟琳就交给你了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们疯了吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有疯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道这样的老工人，他们的经验有多宝贵吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抢手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费斯特！你们——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"假装什么都不知道，你们还能活得久一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不巧，奶奶从小就批评我，不知道在该闭嘴的时候闭嘴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"那你以为你能打赢我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不能，但是她也许可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"什——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵队长","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......混账玩意，呃，还真结实......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢了，乔治。起码出了口恶气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还是先谢费斯特吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......你们这些萨卡兹，不动手吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们的队长说得没有错。我们不该在现在谈论对错。我们没法谈论对错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但如果你甚至不知道自己在为什么而战......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你们不能走......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹雇佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_053","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......没办法了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么回事，其他人呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再没有联络，就只能汇报给——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":"avg_npc_419_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"萨卡兹战士感觉自己身体一轻。\n随着身体不受控制地前倾，他逐渐模糊的视野中出现了一个黑色的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"那是一个萨卡兹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨卡兹战士","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"为......什么......萨卡兹要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡纶","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后一个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虽是自言自语，阿斯卡纶却像是确信一般收起武器。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"从她的位置，可以清晰看到愤怒的工人们将萨卡兹雇佣兵们冲散的场景。\n在积攒了数年的愤怒面前，势单力薄的暴力被摧枯拉朽般冲垮。\n强弱变换了位置，一些往事飘上心头。\n她随即将视线投向某个方向。\n那是伦蒂尼姆中央的位置。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g9_lightinduarea_street_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所有雇佣兵都被绑起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们有多少人受伤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不多。跟着这个孩子的雇佣兵第一时间没有动手，他们全都慌了神。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们甚至没有下定决心战斗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们......我们只是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......起码你们试图反抗，只是被狡诈的伦蒂尼姆人偷袭罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿斯卡纶解决了外围的麻烦。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们的时间并不多。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......本来只有我们几个老东西去死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在倒好，你们所有人都要变成萨卡兹的刀下亡魂了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是你的主意吗，聪明的费斯特？让我们这么多年的忍让全部白费？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果今天我们坐视你们的牺牲而苟且偷生，那么明天，就会出现另一批牺牲者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......直到再没有人真的在意同伴的死活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且......你不能总是替所有人决定这一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说对了，你也不能替所有人决定，费斯特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但这次，是所有人自愿来救奶奶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨卡兹占领城市很多年了......我们的日子很艰难，但有一些底线，我们绝不能失去。如果今天我们不出现在这里，那我们——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伦蒂尼姆工人","speakerId":"avg_npc_659_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会被萨卡兹熬死在这一锅大杂烩里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔治......你们也陪着他胡闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......并不是所有人都在这里。那就说明，有很多人并不愿意看到我活着回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费斯特","speakerId":"avg_4072_ironmn_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......现实的残酷超过你的想象，费斯特，别把人的道德想得那么简单。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但事情已经发生了......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯瑟琳沉默片刻，看向明椒。\n但她终于还是没有说什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯瑟琳","speakerId":"avg_npc_648_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
